# JavaScript Game Collection

## Overview
This project is a collection of simple JavaScript games designed to help learn JavaScript programming concepts including variables, functions, loops, conditionals, arrays, and DOM manipulation.

## Purpose
The purpose of this software is to practice JavaScript programming and create interactive browser-based games.

## Features
- Number Guessing Game
- Score Tracking
- Interactive User Input
- Dynamic DOM Updates

